 of farming and gathering, but also face the challenges of beasts and weaving opponents. Are you ready for the exciting journey of your life?<br>Wish to get a heart, white head not separate! If it were you, who would you choose to spend your life with? Or do kids make choices? I want them all!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573260/extras/72990d421c56d2a038e8047b718249a0.avif?t=1727595143\" width=693 height=240 /></span><br><br><strong>-\u767d\u5c0f\u83b2-</strong><br>\u77e5\u6027\u4eba\u59bb\uff0c\u6e29\u67d4\u61c2\u4e8b\u7684\u8089\u9985\u997c\u644a\u8001\u677f\u5a18<br>\u592b\u541b\u82f1\u5e74\u65e9\u901d\uff0c\u4e34\u7ec8\u524d\u6258\u798f\u4e8e\u4e3b\u89d2<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573260/extras/76e63874f56ec1417d98426fa2872d75.avif?t=1727595143\" width=674 height=564 /></span><br><br><strong>-\u67f3\u5982\u5e08-</strong><br>\u6e05\u98ce\u697c\u82b1\u9b41\uff0c\u50b2\u4eba\u8eab\u6750<br>\u4e3b\u89d2\u5bf9\u5176\u610f\u89c1\u949f\u60c5\uff0c\u4e0d\u60dc\u82b1\u91cd\u91d1\u4e70\u4e0b<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573260/extras/5a5e5db3b4f1d5a59cd3449163c5b764.avif?t=1727595143\" width=728 height=1046 /></span><br><br><strong>-\u828a\u513f-</strong>\uff1a<br>\u4ed9\u6c60\u6c90\u6d74\u7684\u4e0b\u51e1\u4ed9\u5973<br>\u4f53\u6001\u7ea4\u7ec6\uff0c\u4e00\u89c1\u949f\u60c5<br>\u6027\u683c\u6e29\u67d4\u53ef\u7231<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573260/extras/f72258e03e4d5efe8bbda588b994f1a2.avif?t=1727595143\" width=430 height=556 /></span><br><br><strong>-\u5c0f\u7d20-</strong><br>\u8d76\u8003\u4e66\u751f \u77e5\u4e66\u8fbe\u7406<br>\u8a00\u8bed\u53cd\u5dee \u5bb6\u9053\u4e2d\u843d<br>\